Description: testedandbaked mod of BLF EE A6 firmware
  http://budgetlightforum.com/node/38364?page=18#comment-833125  (comment 570)
  https://thedotaroom.com/BLF/BLF-A6-Mod.zip
  This version has:
  * config_star code removed (before I discovered it was not really necessary)
  * Single mode group with 6 modes
  * Memory selection by 16 clicks
  * 20s turbo timeout
  Hidden modes
  * Strobe
  * Turbo
  * Biking strobe
  * Battery check (10% steps with ADC values measured from my Attiny13A and % to voltage conversion from HKJ's tests for the efest 10440)
  * SOS mode
  * Egg timer
Button-Type: clicky
Memory: offtime, OTC, configurable
MCU: attiny13a, attiny25
Authors: testedandbaked, ToyKeeper
Modes: battcheck, tactical strobe, SOS, bike flasher, config, egg timer
Extras: dual PWM, offtime-3, hidden modes
License: GPLv3
